[{"id":180822127,"discussion_id":"b7b9c7e0197c3be0367918cb68e3500163da3dec","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 MSDAGrad（多尺度可变形注意力梯度）算子的确定性实现。在 `multi_scale_deformable_attention_grad.h` 中，两处 `WaitFlag<HardEvent::V_MTE3>` 之后补充了确定性模式下的 `PipeBarrier<PIPE_MTE3>` 调用，确保在启用确定性计算时，向量处理单元与 MTE3 之间的流水线同步严格执行，避免不同硬件单元之间的数据竞争导致非确定性结果。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **添加 `PipeBarrier` 同步原语**：在两处 `DataCopyPad` 将梯度结果写回全局内存之前，新增 `if (isDeterministic) { PipeBarrier<PIPE_MTE3>(); }` 条件判断，仅在确定性模式下插入流水线屏障。\n- **修复梯度输出阶段的同步缺失**：第一处位于普通采样路径的 `gradValueGm` 写回前，第二处位于低分辨率指针偏移路径的双通道 `gradValueGm` 写回前，两处均确保 `WaitFlag` 等待完成后流水线完全排空再执行数据拷贝。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T21:08:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T12:26:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180822130,"discussion_id":"8293925bc9514b04778a9b697349f5c3ea208676","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T21:08:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T12:52:35+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180822148,"discussion_id":"c80edaa509fbed39bcaac2073de911bc51fa1b86","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\